WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:04.410
Speaker 1: We have the resurgence of the Matt
Gates story.

00:00:04.410 --> 00:00:12.049
Now, many of you wrote to me two weeks ago,
last week, maybe even three weeks ago, saying,

00:00:12.049 --> 00:00:14.650
David, what on earth happened to that Matt
Gates investigation?

00:00:14.650 --> 00:00:20.960
We learned that a Republican congressman from
Florida, Matt Gates, has been under investigation

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:23.190
possibly for child sex trafficking.

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:25.080
He may have paid underage girls for sex.

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:28.949
He may have actually paid to transmit them
from one state to another.

00:00:28.949 --> 00:00:32.329
There's all this stuff blowing up with Matt
Gates.

00:00:32.329 --> 00:00:34.130
But then the story just kind of disappeared.

00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:37.320
And my view two weeks ago, my view last week
was it's going to come back.

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:40.840
There have been distractions because of other
things that have been going on, the Joe Biden

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:45.530
address to a joint session of Congress, et
cetera, et cetera, all of these other things.

00:00:45.530 --> 00:00:47.010
The story is now coming back.

00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:51.760
And we are now learning that federal investigators,
as reported by the week, are pushing for the

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:59.330
cooperation of two key witnesses in investigating
Matthew Gates, including an ex-girlfriend

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:00.640
of Matt Gates.

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:05.860
When the investigators talked to the ex-girlfriend,
it's rarely good.

00:01:05.860 --> 00:01:12.100
If the ex-girlfriend cooperates, it's very,
very bad for Matt Gates and investigators

00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:17.980
are looking for cooperation from an ex-girlfriend
who was actually an intern on Capitol Hill.

00:01:17.980 --> 00:01:21.310
I don't think many of us would be shocked
by that.

00:01:21.310 --> 00:01:25.600
And they are also looking for formal cooperation
from that.

00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:31.159
Joel Greenberg, he's the former county tax
collector in Florida who we now have reason

00:01:31.159 --> 00:01:36.640
to believe because of a letter he wrote that
Greenberg himself introduced Matt Gates to

00:01:36.640 --> 00:01:39.700
underage girls.

00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:43.460
This is all potentially disastrous for Matt
Gates.

00:01:43.460 --> 00:01:50.350
The investigation in part is over whether
Gates had sex with a 17 year old girl and

00:01:50.350 --> 00:01:53.490
violated federal sex trafficking laws.

00:01:53.490 --> 00:01:54.630
He's denied wrongdoing.

00:01:54.630 --> 00:01:58.030
The denials are essentially meaningless at
this point.

00:01:58.030 --> 00:02:03.840
And the former girlfriend that investigators
are seeking cooperation from reportedly joined

00:02:03.840 --> 00:02:10.019
Gates in 2018 on a trip to the Bahamas, which
has become a big focus of the investigation.

00:02:10.019 --> 00:02:14.819
She was, quote, involved in some financial
transactions that the FBI has obtained and

00:02:14.819 --> 00:02:20.650
is, quote, believed to have knowledge of drug
use and arrangements with women.

00:02:20.650 --> 00:02:24.499
This is potentially very bad for Matt Gates.

00:02:24.499 --> 00:02:31.180
We expected that as things settled back down
in the U.S., we would get back to the Gates

00:02:31.180 --> 00:02:32.230
story.

00:02:32.230 --> 00:02:37.739
And indeed, the news is starting to flow on
that and consider the insanity.

00:02:37.739 --> 00:02:42.939
To go back to our story about the cancelation
of Republican Congresswoman Liz Cheney, who's

00:02:42.939 --> 00:02:51.760
been voted out of her leadership role because
she said, hey, guys, Trump lost essentially.

00:02:51.760 --> 00:02:58.239
Look at how the Republican Party has been
almost silent on the Gates fiasco, but are

00:02:58.239 --> 00:03:04.719
overly zealous to punish Liz Cheney merely
for saying, yeah, Biden won.

00:03:04.719 --> 00:03:06.470
Consider that incredible hypocrisy.

00:03:06.470 --> 00:03:11.989
And it's not just that they claim to be against
council culture, but they regularly try to

00:03:11.989 --> 00:03:13.019
console people.

00:03:13.019 --> 00:03:16.370
They also regularly, regularly are going after
the wrong people.

00:03:16.370 --> 00:03:23.219
And the Gates Cheney thing is exhibit A and
whether Matt Gates will be charged, we still

00:03:23.219 --> 00:03:24.219
don't know.

00:03:24.219 --> 00:03:26.519
There's a lot of unknowns here, but it is
not looking particularly good

